                        Series</hi>, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">xxxiii</hi>, pp. 181–225.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d769-f3" n="3" xml:id="d769-f3-content">
                <p>For the text of the 1921 Convention see <hi rendition="#italic">League of Nations
                        Treaty Series</hi>, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">xxvi</hi>, pp. 175–199
                    or Department of State, <hi rendition="#italic">Documents and State Papers</hi>,
                    vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, no. 4 (July 1948), pp. 263–268.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
